join Player left
placeholder: Oh, hey, uh... little robot guy? Whats your name again?
leave --All-- 
join "lil fella" right
"lil fella": Uhh, let me check here... *BZZT* Okay, it looks like my name is B-13.
leave --All-- 
join Player left
placeholder: Okay great, B-13.
placeholder: Um, we seem to have a bit of a problem. Theres a giant door in the way.
leave --All-- 
join "lil fella" right
update "lil fella" (confused)
"lil fella": Giant door? Lemme see.
update "lil fella" (happy)
"lil fella": Hmmm... yeah, I think I could hack this, it looks like its from before 2093 when they didn't have cryptotech bulwarks yet.
"lil fella": Just give me a minute here...
update "lil fella" (surprised)
*BZZZZZZZZT*
"lil fella": Whoops, forgot to capitalize that.
update "lil fella" (happy)
"lil fella": There we go, that should do it.
[signal arg="open_door"]

